1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,912
Most people believe that to build a successful startup, you need millions of dollars in funding.

2
00:00:05,862 --> 00:00:08,412
But that is completely false.

3
00:00:08,412 --> 00:00:13,687
In 2026, the biggest leverage is automated AI workflows.

4
00:00:13,687 --> 00:00:23,212
If you find one painful problem, automate the solution, and publish high retention video shorts, you can reach ten million people with zero ad spend.

5
00:00:23,212 --> 00:00:26,600
The secret is not working eighty hours a week.

6
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,262
The secret is building systems that work while you sleep.

